OL,3,GNEWSAVillage primary school celebrates
OL,4,A200th birthday
OL,5,
OL,6,FA primary school which has been
OL,7,Fattended by generations of families is
OL,8,Fcelebrating its 200th year.
OL,10,FAntingham and Southrepps Primary School
OL,11,Fin Norfolk was built in 1826 by Lord
OL,12,FSuffield who wanted to provide an
OL,13,Feducation for the children of the
OL,14,Fworkers on his estate.
OL,16,FAt its last Ofsted inspection in 2023,
OL,17,Fthe school which was rated good, had
OL,18,Fmore than 50 pupils in attendance.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
