OL,3,GNEWSAVillage primary school celebrates
OL,4,A200th birthday
OL,5,
OL,6,FSam Gowland, executive deputy
OL,7,Fheadteacher, said: "It was built for
OL,8,Fthe community and remains a pinnacle to
OL,9,Fthe community and education for these
OL,10,Fchildren."
